01:11:57.600 --> 01:11:58.600
When people don't understand

01:11:58.600 --> 01:12:01.600
why it rains in all the wrong times,

01:12:01.600 --> 01:12:02.600
part of the reason is because

01:12:02.600 --> 01:12:06.600
