01:14:37.600 --> 01:14:40.600
I want to address myself to this question.

01:14:40.600 --> 01:14:41.600
The truth is

01:14:41.600 --> 01:14:43.600
that Ribbi David Nieto points out

01:14:43.600 --> 01:14:45.600
that controversies emerge

01:14:45.600 --> 01:14:47.600
in Jewish tradition

01:14:47.600 --> 01:14:49.600
only after the destruction of the Temple.

01:14:49.600 --> 01:14:56.600
[inaudible]

01:14:56.600 --> 01:14:58.600
It appears, מחלוקת,

01:14:58.600 --> 01:15:02.600
at a critical point in Jewish history.

01:15:02.600 --> 01:15:04.600
And the answer to this is

01:15:04.600 --> 01:15:06.600
that the Jewish Sanhedrin,

01:15:06.600 --> 01:15:08.600
to be a Sanhedrin,

01:15:08.600 --> 01:15:13.600
[inaudible]

01:15:13.600 --> 01:15:14.600
אשר מושם.

01:15:14.600 --> 01:15:16.600
The Sanhedrin has to be part

01:15:16.600 --> 01:15:18.600
of the Bet HaMikdash.

01:15:18.600 --> 01:15:20.600
And if the Sanhedrin is not part

01:15:20.600 --> 01:15:22.600
of the Bet HaMikdash,

01:15:22.600 --> 01:15:24.600
it is not a Sanhedrin.

01:15:24.600 --> 01:15:25.600
Therefore,

01:15:25.600 --> 01:15:27.600
with the destruction of the Bet HaMikdash

01:15:27.600 --> 01:15:29.600
and even before that,

01:15:29.600 --> 01:15:31.600
we can no longer

01:15:31.600 --> 01:15:34.600
apply capital punishment

01:15:34.600 --> 01:15:37.600
because we had no Sanhedrin.

01:15:37.600 --> 01:15:39.600
Now,

01:15:39.600 --> 01:15:40.600
the Ben ha-Qadosh,

01:15:40.600 --> 01:15:42.600
he had a court.

01:15:42.600 --> 01:15:45.600
But his court was not a Sanhedrin

01:15:45.600 --> 01:15:47.600
because the Temple was destroyed

01:15:48.600 --> 01:15:50.600
and no matter how much

01:15:50.600 --> 01:15:52.600
people liked him and loved him,

01:15:52.600 --> 01:15:56.600
he was not a Sanhedrin.

01:15:56.600 --> 01:15:57.600
And therefore,

01:15:57.600 --> 01:15:59.600
the Ben ha-Qadosh by law,

01:15:59.600 --> 01:16:01.600
from a point of view of law,

01:16:01.600 --> 01:16:04.600
he cannot settle

01:16:04.600 --> 01:16:06.600
the controversy once and for all

01:16:06.600 --> 01:16:08.600
because he is only

01:16:08.600 --> 01:16:10.600
a court

01:16:10.600 --> 01:16:13.600
but is not the Supreme Court of Israel.

01:16:13.600 --> 01:16:14.600
Supreme Court of Israel,

01:16:14.600 --> 01:16:16.600
it has to be part

01:16:16.600 --> 01:16:17.600
of the Bet HaMikdash.

01:16:17.600 --> 01:16:18.600
And that's why,

01:16:18.600 --> 01:16:19.600
yes,

01:16:19.600 --> 01:16:21.600
we always said,

01:16:23.600 --> 01:16:25.600
let the building of the Bet HaMikdash be rebuilt soon.

01:16:25.600 --> 01:16:26.600
Why?

01:16:26.600 --> 01:16:28.600
Because unless,

01:16:28.600 --> 01:16:30.600
from the point of view of Jewish thinking,

01:16:30.600 --> 01:16:33.600
unless we have a Bet HaMikdash,

01:16:33.600 --> 01:16:36.600
we cannot have a Supreme Court.

01:16:36.600 --> 01:16:38.600
So that's more or less the answer.

